Dear GenABEL users,

Today MetABEL version 0.1-0 was accepted on CRAN. This version contains
mostly small fixes needed to keep the package accepted by CRAN. The only
user-visible changes are in the documentation where several lines that
were too long have been made to fit within the margins.

If you run into any bugs please let us know in our bug tracker [1]. For
support questions, please use the GenABEL forum [2].


Best regards,

Lennart Karssen.

